TI  - Study of aerosol effect on accelerated snow melting over the Tibetan Plateau during boreal spring
AU  - Woo‐Seop Lee
PY  - 2013
JO  - Atmospheric Environment
DO  - 10.1016/j.atmosenv.2013.04.004
